{"id":"kran","lemma":"кран","pos":"noun","rank":4749,"glosses":["valve (a ball valve, a plug valve, or similar rotating device controlling flow through a pipe)","faucet, tap, spigot","crane"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/ab/Ru-%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BD.ogg/Ru-%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BD.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"крана","plural":"краны"},"examples":[{"text":"Кто кран не закрыл?","en":"Who left the water running?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1283519","words":[{"g":"who"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to cover, to hide","l":"закрыть"}]},{"text":"Из крана капала вода.","en":"Water was dripping from the tap.","words":[{"g":"from / out of"},null,null,{"g":"water"}]},{"text":"Я включил кран.","en":"I turned the tap on.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to switch on","l":"включить"},null]},{"text":"Мне не нравится вкус воды из-под крана.","en":"I don't like the taste of tap water.","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to like","l":"нравиться"},{"g":"taste"},{"g":"water","l":"вода"},{"g":"from / out of"},{"g":"under, below, beneath"},null]},{"text":"Том повернул кран.","en":"Tom turned the valve.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to turn, to swing","l":"повернуть"},null]}]}